          <h1 class="hero-title">
            Hi, I'm <span class="hero-name">Harshitaa Kashyap</span>.
          </h1>

          <p class="hero-tagline">
            Final-year CSE undergrad at VIT Vellore. I build backend systems
            and full-stack web apps, currently a Digital R&amp;D intern at
            <span class="kw">Sanofi</span>, working on an AI-powered virtual lab.
          </p>

