            I'm a CS student who enjoys building things. Lately that's mostly been Go, React, and whatever else a project needs. I like writing clean code, keeping things simple, and making sure they actually work.
            </p>
            <p>
            Outside of code, I spend a lot of time at hackathons. When I'm not doing that, I'm probably drawing, reading, singing, meeting new people, or planning my next trip.
            </p>
